  "contract": "PvE Mode prevents attacking or being attacked by other players, and Mercenary for Hire! only makes its user hostile to their own faction while in War Mode or High-Risk. A level 20 High-Risk Mercenary and a same-faction PvE Mode player therefore cannot attack each other in either direction and the PvE player receives the Mercenary's race faction, while a same-faction High-Risk player and the Mercenary can still attack each other and that player receives the Outlaw faction 1163. Rendering, AoE and pets are untested.",
